{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10133050","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10133050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1013305001:2":{"text":"영지에서 이렇게 많은 사람을 만난 게 얼마 만인지 모르겠네요. 특히 마법사와 기사의 조합은 정말 새롭네요...","source_cn":"很少在这个营地看到这么多人，尤其是魔法师和圣骑士的组合...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDB0AE0AEA452F21B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"영지에서 이렇게 많은 사람을 만난 게 얼마 만인지 모르겠네요. 특히 마법사와 기사의 조합은 정말 새롭네요...","female":"영지에서 이렇게 많은 사람을 만난 게 얼마 만인지 모르겠네요. 특히 마법사와 기사의 조합은 정말 새롭네요...","variant_male_record_index":"114307","variant_female_record_index":"114308","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013305002:1":{"text":"...바로 본론부터 이야기하죠. 여기서 어떤 연구를 하고 있나요?","source_cn":"……言归正传。你们在这里做的是什么研究？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98089FD50B77DBF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013305003:1":{"text":"원래는 성석을 연구하려고 했는데... 성석을 도난당했어요. 그래서 성석의 역사적 자료 연구부터 진행하고 있죠.","source_cn":"我们本想研究圣石的，但圣石已经失窃。就只能先从史料入手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B5BCF455E93B288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013305004:1":{"text":"예를 들어 성석이 처음 나타난 지역이라거나...","source_cn":"比如说圣石第一次出现的区域——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6E91FC657CE4C27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013305005:1":{"text":"그게 여긴가요?","source_cn":"就是这里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8D1081C5833741D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013305006:1":{"text":"맞아요! 바로 뒤에 있는 이 작은 유적지죠.","source_cn":"没错！正是我们身后的这片小型遗址。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BBEF85A292EBBFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013305007:1":{"text":"솔직히 성석 마을에서 오래 살았지만, 성석에 대해서 알아본 적은 딱히 없는 것 같네요.","source_cn":"我必须说，在圣石镇讨了这么久的生活，我居然一直都没怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA346E327B14EFBC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013305008:1":{"text":"장군님께 말로만 전해 들은 게 다였어요. 예전엔 마을 중앙에 있는 장식대에 끼워져 있었다고 하더군요.","source_cn":"只是听将军说过，那块石头之前一直镶嵌在镇中心的台座上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24184031BAA3EFD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013305009:1":{"text":"하지만 도난당했고, 다시 찾지 못했죠... 아, 미리 말씀드리지만, 제가 한 건 아닙니다?","source_cn":"直到被盗，下落不明……事先声明，可不是我干的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD023F5DC5637C0D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013305010:1":{"text":"...하나도 안 웃겨요.","source_cn":"……一点也不好笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5F5EF0050C8B9ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013305011:2":{"text":"아! 장난이라곤 하나도 모르는 분이었죠? 제가 잊고 있었네요.","source_cn":"啊，忘了你没有幽默感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68E908BB8EBBF9DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1013305012:1":{"text":"발렌 님! 당신은 몰랐겠지만, 그때 성석 도난 사건을 조사하던 사람이 바로 테미히아입니다!","source_cn":"维伦，你不了解！当年负责追查圣石失窃一事的，正是特弥希娅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6370452EF905634","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1013305013:1":{"text":"그 일 때문에 승진까지 누락되고, 아주 곤란한 상황에 처했었다고요!","source_cn":"因为这件事还耽误升职，真是冤枉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE1AE0A247ADE184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1013305014:1":{"text":"테미히아가 그 범인을 잡거나 성석을 되찾아오지는 못했지만, 성당이 맡긴 임무는 항상 제대로 완수해 왔어요. 이것만으로도...","source_cn":"特弥希娅虽然没能带回案犯和圣石，但是把圣堂交待的任务都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAD2B4C09B377182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1013305015:1":{"text":"정말 너무하네요! 어떻게 그럴 수가 있죠? 테미히아 언니는 책임감 있고 착한 사람이란 말이에요!","source_cn":"太过分了！怎么能这么做！特弥希娅姐姐是一个尽责又善良的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91E790F6AED975F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1013305016:1":{"text":"페이...","source_cn":"菲，你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0435CC0985B354AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1013305016":{"text":"페이...","source_cn":"菲，你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0435CC0985B354AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1013305017:2":{"text":"...으악! 알려주셔서 감사합니다!","source_cn":"——哦哦！多谢提醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAB8047824AAE9F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1013305018:1":{"text":"우리에게 줄 수 있는 성석 정보가 더 있는 것 같은데요. 맞나요?","source_cn":"我想，你能提供给我们更多有关圣石的情报，是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95E0791B733CAA30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1013305019:3":{"text":"오! 화제 전환이 아주 빠르군요. 어디 보자... 더 알고 싶은 게 있다면...","source_cn":"哇！话题转得真快。让我想想，如果你们还有想知道的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D67C53132837EE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1013305020:1":{"text":"석각 유적에 가서 성석의 역사를 직접 확인해 보는 것도 좋을 것 같네요.","source_cn":"或许你们可以去石刻遗址看看，亲眼见证圣石的历史。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A2CFBB0F28CBD31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"크흠, 루시우스? 깃털관이 비뚤어졌어","source_cn":"咳咳，卢修斯，你的翼冠歪了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C9B42370BC94C75","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"크흠, 루시우스? 깃털관이 비뚤어졌어","female":"크흠, 루시우스? 깃털관이 비뚤어졌어","variant_male_record_index":"62016","variant_female_record_index":"62017","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:1:2":{"text":"성석의 역사에 대해 더 알고 싶어","source_cn":"我们想知道更多圣石的历史","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65B15C400F3EC24C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"성석의 역사에 대해 더 알고 싶어","female":"성석의 역사에 대해 더 알고 싶어","variant_male_record_index":"62018","variant_female_record_index":"62019","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:乌尔曼":{"text":"우르만","source":"乌尔曼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"루시우스","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":5}}